flowchart TD
MOO_Algorithm["**MOO Algorithm**<br/>NSGA2 controller run_nsga2_optimization<br/>sampling crossover mutation selection"]
Population["**Population**<br/>Individuals with 6 buffer capacities<br/>caps per individual {1-10}"]
BufferCapacityProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Defines decision variables n_var 6<br/>_evaluate schedules parallel evaluations"]
Parallel_Evaluator["**Parallel Evaluator**<br/>multiprocessing Pool map tasks<br/>evaluates many individuals in parallel"]
Evaluator_Function["**Evaluator Function**<br/>evaluate_single_individual<br/>runs n replications and averages metrics"]
Simulation_Runner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>run_simulation_with_caps builds model with caps<br/>returns throughput wip and energy"]
DelayBuffer_Class["**DelayBuffer**<br/>attributes cap delay tokens store<br/>methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
Machine_Class["**Machine**<br/>attributes process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
Metrics_Aggregation["**Metrics Aggregation**<br/>compute throughput wip produced parts<br/>aggregate machine energy and samples"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Minimize wip<br/>Maximize throughput"]
Result_Exporter["**Result Exporter**<br/>export_history_to_csv writes generation history to CSV<br/>saves per generation caps wip throughput"]
Production_Manager["**Production Manager**<br/>Provides goals approves trade offs<br/>reviews CSV results"]

